    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12091" root="دث" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَثٌّ</span></b>  <i>Weak rain;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دِثَاثٌ</span></b> ; (S, K;) the
latter [in the CK <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَثاث</span>, but it is] with kesr: or
the <i>weakest and lightest of rain;</i> and the pl. is
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دِثَاثٌ</span>: or, accord. to IAar, <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَكٌّ</span>: (TA:) or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَكٌّ</span> signifies rain exceeding what is termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَثٌّ</span>.
(K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رك</span>.)

